of Sjögren’s syndrome? 
D. Spoerl, P. Roux-Lombard 
Division of Laboratory Medicine, Department of Diagnostics, Geneva University 
Hospitals, Geneva 
Introduction: The 2016 American College of Rheumatology (ACR) -
European League Against Rheumatism (EULAR) classification criteria

