Deciphering CD4+ T cell immunodominance to Influenza virus 
Antonino Cassotta1,2, Philipp Paparoditis1, Roger Geiger1, Ramgopal R. 
Mettu4, Samuel J. Landry4, Alessia Donati1, Marco Benevento1, 
