(GPCR)-mediated signaling, known to modulate  chemokine receptor -
mediated immune cell trafficking. Accordingly we hypothesized that 
Rgs1 regulates the non-recirculating properties of TRM CD8 T cells and 
controls the generation, maintenance and function of TRM CD8 T cells, 
notably, the TRM cell-mediated protection from pathogen dissemination 
after local infection. 
