quantitative image analysis, we found that overal l lymphatic vessels, 
identified by Prox -1+ and Podoplanin+ labeling, are located almost 
exclusively in the stroma surrounding the tumor. As expected, CD8 T -
cell infiltration was significantly denser in the stroma compared to the 
tumor. 
